/- File: SessionMultiLib/Integration.lean

  The session half of the integration.ml translation: it supplies
  HolMultiLib.Integration's dependencies (derivatives.ml's `DerivativesDeps`
  and the extra theorems from Session, SessionLibrary and SessionMultiLib),
  and exports every theorem by name.  Importing this module is
  `needs "Multivariate/integration.ml"`: its own `needs` (Library/products.ml,
  Library/floor.ml and derivatives.ml) are its imports, and each bundle is
  built by `initialize` when the module is loaded, in file order.
-/

